<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Suburban Ostomy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Suburban Ostomy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns upgraded Suburban Ostomy Supply Co Inc to buy from attractive, a Bear Stearns source said.</p>
<p>-- further details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
